• Bidirectional Auto-sync on Entry: Auto-commits and pushes local changes upon opening notes, with customizable cooldown (default: 60s).
• Plain Text Git Diff: Compare current edits with HEAD commit for .txt/.md/.html with color-coded Unified Diff.
• HTML Visual Preview: Render .html/.htm notes via WebView with seamless "Edit ⇄ Preview" toggle.
• GitHub Repo Prefix: Filter repos with custom prefix (default: note) or leave blank for all repos.
• App Version & Support: View version in Settings, email feedback to william@kafeiou.pw, view Privacy Policy.
• Markdown & PDF: GFM preview, Mermaid charts, [[WikiLinks]], native PDF viewer with zoom & unlock.
• DayNight Theme, Temp Files Exclude (.gitignore), Zero-permission Backup & JGit 7.7.1.
